# part: Week 2 - the same language, monadic
# dir: week2/solution
# load: :m + APL.AST APL.Eval
? Same Let as yesterday. What changed in the ANSWER, and what changed in the CODE?
runEval (eval (Let "x" (CstInt 2) (Add (Var "x") (CstInt 1))))
? Failure: who is doing the Left-checking now that eval no longer does it?
runEval (eval (Div (CstInt 1) (CstInt 0)))
? A closure again - compare with yesterday's env plumbing
runEval (eval (Apply (Lambda "x" (Add (Var "x") (CstInt 1))) (CstInt 41)))
? TryCatch in the monadic evaluator
runEval (eval (TryCatch (Div (CstInt 1) (CstInt 0)) (CstInt 42)))
? Nested TryCatch: QB section 1 Q10 territory
runEval (eval (TryCatch (TryCatch (Var "x") (Div (CstInt 1) (CstInt 0))) (CstInt 7)))
